WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.830
A living cell is a marvel
of order: membranes,

2
00:00:03.880 --> 00:00:08.660
concentration gradients, long
molecules built from simple parts.

3
00:00:08.710 --> 00:00:14.290
Physics says every energy transformation
increases the disorder of the universe.

4
00:00:14.340 --> 00:00:17.760
Yet living things build that
order from simple molecules,

5
00:00:17.810 --> 00:00:19.420
and keep building it.

6
00:00:19.470 --> 00:00:23.710
So how does a cell stay so
ordered without breaking physics?

7
00:00:23.760 --> 00:00:27.090
In this mission, you'll meet
the two laws of thermodynamics,

8
00:00:27.140 --> 00:00:29.080
and test life against them.

9
00:00:29.130 --> 00:00:34.350
Then you'll compare burning sugar in a
flame with breaking it down in small steps.

10
00:00:34.400 --> 00:00:39.710
Your mission: explain how a cell stays
ordered without breaking the laws of physics.
